    "facilitator_note": {
      "en": "Course Flow: The course’s readings will mainly focus on the works of Andrew Bowie; Music, Philosophy and Modernity, Aesthetics and Subjectivity. Together we will critically engage with readings as well as moving back and forth between the themes we discuss, experimenting with some of them - as infusing two distinct themes through discussion and listening - in order to widen our perspectives regarding the reciprocal relation between philosophy and music.\n\nAs discussions would unfold through the course, more suggestions than the ones stated below would be welcomed.",
